:\"Dubbi tra iPhone 17 e iPhone 18? Ecco come decidere in base a priorità, tempistiche, valore dell’acquisto e scenari d’uso.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/iPhone-17-One-Year-Later-Thumb-1.5-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-17-One-Year-Later-Thumb-1.5\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16956,\"date\":\"2026-08-15T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-15T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"pubblicita-in-arrivo-su-apple-maps-slot-acquistabili-usa-canada\",\"title\":\"Pubblicità in arrivo su Apple Maps: slot acquistabili negli USA e in Canada\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple Maps si prepara ad accogliere annunci: negli USA e in Canada le aziende possono acquistare slot pubblicitari a partire da oggi, con un credito introduttivo del 15%.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Ads-Are-Coming-to-Apple-Maps-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Ads-Are-Coming-to-Apple-Maps-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16940,\"date\":\"2026-08-15T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-15T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-valuta-commissione-fino-al-15-per-link-fuori-dall-app-store\",\"title\":\"Apple valuta una commissione fino al 15% per i link fuori dall’App Store\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple starebbe valutando una commissione per gli sviluppatori fino al 15% quando le app includono link che portano fuori dall’App Store.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Liquid-Glass-App-Store-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Liquid-Glass-App-Store-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16949,\"date\":\"2026-08-14T14:55:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-14T12:55:34+00:00\",\"slug\":\"cosa-aspettarsi-a-settembre-nuovi-iphone-apple-watch-e-novita-ai\",\"title\":\"Cosa aspettarsi a settembre: nuovi iPhone, Apple Watch e possibili novità AI\",\"excerpt\":\"Settembre potrebbe portare almeno cinque nuovi dispositivi all’evento incentrato su iPhone: iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max, il primo iPhone pieghevole (“Ultra”), Apple Watch Series 12 e Ultra 4. In parallelo, Apple potrebbe estendere l’integrazione Siri AI anche ad altri prodotti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/iPhone-18-Pro-Rumored-Colors-768x384.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-18-Pro-Rumored-Colors\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16951,\"date\":\"2026-08-14T14:50:08+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-14T12:50:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-base-due-upgrade-pro\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 base verso due upgrade “pro”: cosa potrebbe cambiare\",\"excerpt\":\"Le indiscrezioni sull’iPhone 18 base puntano a due upgrade di livello “pro”. Ecco quali cambiamenti potrebbero arrivare e perché contano per l’esperienza d’uso.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/iphone-17-ceramic-shield-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-ceramic-shield\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16947,\"date\":\"2026-08-14T14:33:10+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-14T12:33:10+00: